invariant: INV-8
file: handshake.c
catches: webpki_session_test
reason: the retry hello a cookie HelloRetryRequest asked for goes out under
  legacy_record_version 0x0301, which RFC 9846 section 5.1 admits only on
  the initial ClientHello. Every retry this client answers carries a
  cookie, so the cookie is what marks the retry hello.

--- old
    t->tx[2] = h->cookie_len > 0 ? 0x03 : 0x01;
--- new
    t->tx[2] = 0x01;
